  "theorem": "Across the bounded tracked premultiplier-clean archive, the reflected mirror axis and offset 4 are intrinsic. The receipt Gram matrix selects a one-dimensional orientation line but not its sign. G5 admits a nonsplit C4 extension with two inverse order-four lifts, but neither terminal G5 geometry nor clean tracked ancestry selects one lift or identifies it with the positive rather than negative D5 generator. Offsets 1 and 2 therefore remain exchanged."
